              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo mwanya Abimeleki ahamagara umusore umutwaje intwaro ati “Kura inkota yawe unyice, hatagira uvuga yuko nishwe n'umugore.” Uwo musore aramusogota arapfa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.9.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.9.54"
            ]
          }
        },
